    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114137" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλεύη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>joke, jest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Cer.
				202
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλεύην ποιεῖσθαί</span>
			or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίθεσθαί τινα</span> (or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>) make <i>a jest</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
